mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="仿宋"><p>This course is a comprehensive course that involves the reproduction of fundamental theories, the manifestation of more applicable new theories and theories, as well as interactive discussions and learning between teachers and students. Its ultimate goal is to cultivate high-level medical and biological talents with broad knowledge, solid foundation, strong abilities, and emphasis on humanities in the 21st century.</p></font></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;font-size:10.5000pt;
